Takenaga!

00:13:35.714 --> 00:13:40.481
Noi is here! Teeheehee!

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:44.023
I'm so scared! I'm so scared!

00:13:44.023 --> 00:13:48.119
Stop crying! Takenaga is going to bring
some rope or a ladder truck soon!

00:13:48.561 --> 00:13:50.051
Don't yell at me!

00:13:51.197 --> 00:13:55.998
If only he were a beautifuI girI,
then I wouldn't mind this so much.

00:13:59.772 --> 00:14:01.106
I'm here for you.

00:14:01.106 --> 00:14:02.971
Oh, you're so dependable.

00:14:03.175 --> 00:14:04.176
Come on now...

00:14:04.176 --> 00:14:07.145
Oh yes! You are so dependable!

00:14:08.013 --> 00:14:12.211
I wish I had a cute little animaI with me now.

00:14:16.455 --> 00:14:18.923
Wow, this is so comforting!

00:14:20.192 --> 00:14:21.750
Sigh . . .

00:14:22.294 --> 00:14:26.526
Anyway, we just have to hang in
there a little longer, I hope.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:28.396
Huh?

00:14:35.908 --> 00:14:38.611
I never would have thought I'd
find such luscious fruit

00:14:38.611 --> 00:14:40.476
on an uninhabited island like this!

00:14:40.813 --> 00:14:43.179
Huh? What did you say? H.. Hey!

00:14:50.389 --> 00:14:54.326
What's a panda doing here?
It's a reaI panda!

00:14:54.326 --> 00:14:57.022
I can't take it anymore!

00:14:57.563 --> 00:15:00.361
Who would've thought I'd find
you in a place like this!

00:15:00.966 --> 00:15:02.593
Let me hold you tight!

00:15:02.968 --> 00:15:06.028
Ropes... or a ladder truck...
I guess we don't have either.

00:15:06.338 --> 00:15:07.506
Ointment and a good luck charm...
I guess I'd need some salt too.

00:15:07.506 --> 00:15:09.201
Is anyone in there?
Ointment and a good luck charm...
I guess I'd need some salt too.

00:15:19.385 --> 00:15:21.546
D.. Dinosaur?!

00:15:22.221 --> 00:15:24.155
Takenaga, I found you!

00:15:26.859 --> 00:15:32.161
Noi! It's almost done, so have a
seat and wait just a minute.

00:15:32.431 --> 00:15:38.370
Ta.. Ta.. Takenaga is naked
with only an apron on!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:43.364
D.. D.. Dinosaur! Not only that it's ...

00:15:45.778 --> 00:15:48.906
Don't stare at me like that.

00:15:51.617 --> 00:15:53.719
This is too much!

00:15:53.719 --> 00:15:56.388
I can't take this anymore!

00:15:56.388 --> 00:15:58.324
That dinosaur is...

00:15:58.324 --> 00:16:00.759
Oh, no! Don't eat me!

00:16:00.759 --> 00:16:03.227
Let me eat you!

00:16:09.868 --> 00:16:11.165
Where am I?

00:16:12.638 --> 00:16:14.773
Sunako Nakahara, are you in there?

00:16:14.773 --> 00:16:16.741
So, you came, eh?

00:16:17.209 --> 00:16:22.681
The time has come for me to
raise the flag of Wing!

00:16:22.681 --> 00:16:24.350
You shall die!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:27.581
Huh? Have you been possessed for reaI?!

00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:31.286
Now is the time for our departure!

00:16:31.757 --> 00:16:33.691
Lads!

00:16:38.864 --> 00:16:39.831
Huh?

00:16:40.132 --> 00:16:41.690
The boss is calling!

00:16:41.867 --> 00:16:44.199
I can't take this anymore!

00:16:46.071 --> 00:16:47.595
Huh? The boss is calling!

00:16:54.646 --> 00:17:04.521
Captain Wing! Captain Wing! Captain Wing!

00:17:05.758 --> 00:17:08.594
I'm glad you all made it!

00:17:08.594 --> 00:17:14.794
We'II make an offering of this beautifuI boy,
and come back to life!

00:17:16.235 --> 00:17:18.203
Captain Wing!

00:17:18.437 --> 00:17:21.167
Hey, what the hell do you think you're
doing with those frickin' ghosts?!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.498
Wing!

00:17:23.108 --> 00:17:26.339
Sunako Nakahara, snap out of it, damn it!
Let me down now!

00:17:28.347 --> 00:17:31.475
What a feisty sacrifice!

00:17:31.984 --> 00:17:34.153
In order for us to be resurrected...

00:17:34.153 --> 00:17:35.120
Huh?!

00:17:37.122 --> 00:17:39.391
Skeletons! Skeletons! Skeletons! Skeletons!

00:17:39.391 --> 00:17:45.264
Skeletons! Skeletons! Skeletons! Skeletons!
There are so many of them!

00:17:45.264 --> 00:17:46.891
B.. Boss...

00:17:49.334 --> 00:17:52.171
The boss is rubbing against me!

00:17:52.171 --> 00:17:53.297
Yeew!

00:17:54.206 --> 00:17:58.267
Why?! I can't controI my body!

00:18:01.613 --> 00:18:03.382
Huh? Sunako?

00:18:03.382 --> 00:18:05.373
Huh? Noi? What are you doing here?

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:09.955
Well, you left me behind.
That was so mean!

00:18:09.955 --> 00:18:14.153
I'm sorry, Noi, but I didn't want
to put you in danger.

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.695
This is no time for that!

00:18:16.695 --> 00:18:18.663
Huh? What are you guys doing?

00:18:22.901 --> 00:18:25.096
Get 'em, lads!

00:18:26.772 --> 00:18:28.107
Are you kidding me?!

00:18:28.107 --> 00:18:29.472
