00:18:32.277 --> 00:18:35.414
Shut up! You're not going to live long anyway!

00:18:35.414 --> 00:18:36.982
What was that?!

00:18:36.982 --> 00:18:38.884
I don't care if you're a pirate or what,

00:18:38.884 --> 00:18:42.020
how dare you dress me up like this
while I was unconcsious?!

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.510
What kind of a pervert are you?!

00:18:43.989 --> 00:18:48.153
You're a little noisy sacrifice!
You wanna be eaten by sharks that badly?!

00:18:50.028 --> 00:18:53.395
Don't come near me! I'm Takenaga's girI!

00:18:56.502 --> 00:18:59.630
Even if I must fight skeletons,
I will protect you, Noi!

00:19:00.005 --> 00:19:01.563
You're awesome, Takenaga!

00:19:02.641 --> 00:19:03.575
Ouch...

00:19:03.575 --> 00:19:04.633
You're still awesome!

00:19:05.344 --> 00:19:07.175
I'm not scared! I'm not scared!

00:19:08.046 --> 00:19:10.913
My being surrounded by mannequins
