00:19:40.245 --> 00:19:41.974
Sunako, wake up!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:43.849
Don't let a ghost beat you!

00:19:43.849 --> 00:19:44.816
Sunako!

00:19:51.023 --> 00:19:55.027
How dare you?! I will not give in to you fools!

00:19:55.027 --> 00:19:56.628
Listen up, you son of a bitch!

00:19:56.628 --> 00:20:00.365
This girI right here is a hundred times
stronger than your candy ass!

00:20:00.365 --> 00:20:03.232
