00:20:18.617 --> 00:20:22.075
Why? Why is this woman acting
against my will?

00:20:22.387 --> 00:20:23.388
Shut up!

00:20:23.388 --> 00:20:24.223
Excuse me?

00:20:24.223 --> 00:20:26.258
Step aside, you half-asleep fooI!

00:20:26.258 --> 00:20:30.354
I'm the one who's going to kill
the Creature of Light!

00:20:36.301 --> 00:20:39.964
Whoa! Boss!

00:20:47.112 --> 00:20:52.175
Th.. That girI is a frickin' weirdo!

00:21:00.626 --> 00:21:02.961
Whoa! So radiant! Skeleton! Pirate!

00:21:02.961 --> 00:21:03.795
Sunako!
Whoa! So radiant! Skeleton! Pirate!

00:21:03.795 --> 00:21:04.396
Calm down!

00:21:04.396 --> 00:21:04.796
Snap out of it!
Calm down!

00:21:04.796 --> 00:21:05.797
Snap out of it!

00:21:05.797 --> 00:21:07.162
Sunako!

00:21:07.733 --> 00:21:08.859
Sunako!

00:21:12.004 --> 00:21:14.006
Is she done now?

00:21:14.006 --> 00:21:19.273
I guess her will to kill Kyohei with her
own hands overcame that ghost?

00:21:19.645 --> 00:21:21.980
I don't know if I should be happy or not.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:22.947
Jeez!

00:21:27.486 --> 00:21:30.355
Hi, guys! What did you think?

00:21:30.355 --> 00:21:34.314
I got a really good price on the island because
